## Quick Start

### OpenClaw (Unbrowse) workflow
- Authenticate in the browser first (no credentials are shipped with this skill).
- Capture fresh auth locally: run `unbrowse_capture` on an authenticated page for this domain.
- Execute via backend gate + client browser executor: `unbrowse_replay` with `executionMode="backend"`.

Example:
```text
unbrowse_replay { service: "gotofinancial", executionMode: "backend", endpoint: "GET /" }
```

Here are a few examples to get you started:

```typescript
// Fetch the first page of feed updates.
const feed = await client.get({ page: 1 });
console.log(feed.updates);
```

```typescript
// Fetch feed updates and iterate through them.
let page = 1;
let hasMore = true;
while (hasMore) {
  const feed = await client.get({ page });
  if (feed.updates.length === 0) {
    hasMore = false;
  } else {
    feed.updates.forEach(update => {
      console.log(update.title);
    });
    page++;
  }
}
```

